  "common_changes": [
    "Native upstream FSDP checkpoint serialization restored; only read-only checkpoint phase and tensor-placement observations added",
    "Synchronous CPU optimizer transfer for both arms",
    "Container host-memory limit and native Ray memory monitor; no added CUDA allocator limit",
    "Read-only training updates and parameter-change observations",
    "Resume CLI supports native val_only mode to validate step-10 restoration without further optimizer updates",
    "vLLM KV-cache block count fixed to 73836; independent of startup memory profiling",
    "Wait for owned Ray child processes to exit before a subsequent launch"
  ],
